Install Required PHP Extensions
First, install the necessary extensions for Laravel:
sudo dnf install php-mbstring php-xml php-bcmath php-curl php-gd php-mysql php-zip php-intl php-soap php-xmlrpc php-json php-openssl

/etc/php.ini

extension=mbstring
extension=xml
extension=bcmath
extension=curl
extension=gd
extension=pdo_mysql
extension=zip
extension=intl
extension=soap
extension=xmlrpc
extension=json
extension=openssl
